title The floor that votes only where one sentence could have carried it
prompt kg -- take %430, whose derived door Keaton granted.
think Implemented the second condition exactly as %430 derived it, gap times sentences under 100, rather than inventing a shape of my own, since the row had already argued the alternative (abstention in the mean) and declined it for editing mean_of_four_reads.
think Read the ceiling from the SETTING rather than always from Door. The row measured Door pages and wrote |share - DOOR_MAX|, and prose_register_scan.sh publishes FIELD_MAX=30 beside DOOR_MAX=20 -- reasoning about a Field page against Door's ceiling would score pages the law never put over one.
think Lifted both ceilings from prose_register_scan.sh the way the card already lifts the floor and the measure(), so the number this door reasons about and the number the wall enforces cannot drift apart. A missing FIELD_MAX refuses rather than guesses.
think Published the floor finding as its own key, register_floor_met, because the register now asks a second question the grade reading does not, and an earlier round had to repair those two readings disagreeing about whether there was prose to measure. The agreement leg reads the floor finding now rather than the mode.
obs The three pages %430 named came out at its predicted numbers: JET_DEC.md A/94 -> C+/76, wiki/README.md A/94 -> B/80, and libraries/README.md still freed at n=1 with a share of 100, which the row itself said must stay free.
obs Measured on 442 living pages -- tracked Markdown outside gratitude, vendor and seed, and outside dated testimony. 268 stand at or above the floor, 122 stay freed, 52 become scored. Mean fall 12.8 points, largest 25, and 25 of the 52 leave the B door they had been passing on a blank vote. The set is narrower than the row's 870, so the two counts are named as not comparable rather than quietly compared.
obs THE CONTROL CAUGHT MY OWN REPAIR. The elder-card leg rewrites the floor condition to if false, to tell a repair from a rewording. I had computed the new distance inside the branch that uses it, and the card runs under set -u, so a detail line read it unset on every path that does not take the branch -- which is the one path that leg exists to walk. Computed unconditionally now, being a pure function of two numbers already in hand.
obs A leg built to prove the elder was wrong is also the leg that reads the new code on a path the new code does not take. That is worth more than the assertion it was written for.
obs Four control legs stand where two did: the far share scored and costing, the seated n=1 case still free, and a share NEAR the ceiling still free. The last is what makes this a rule rather than score-everything-past-one-sentence, and without it the amendment could not be told from a headcount.
obs The row then carried the pin to 25,802 against 24,576, so %430 folded to its own shelf in the round that closed it. Pin reads 18,585.
loom pages_measured=442 at_or_above_floor=268 still_freed=122 newly_scored=52 mean_grade_fall=12.8 largest_fall=25 crossed_out_of_B=25
file tools/fixtures/q/qa_report_card.sh the second condition, both ceilings lifted from one source, the gap computed unconditionally, and the floor finding published on its own
file tools/fixtures/q/qa_report_card_control.sh four legs where two stood, each proven from both sides
file tools/q/qa_report_card_witness.rish the seated assertion amended, with the n=1 reasoning kept whole
file construction/REDS.md %430 repaired and CLOSED, then folded
file construction/archive/REDS-a-floor-that-voted-rows-430.md the row whole, with its measurement
file construction/ITINERARY.md the live front carries the close and its numbers
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- %431 is the last granted red and it touches the seed publisher at gate %1, so it wants your eye on the shape before I build it into birth_a_clone.
